WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.690
In Genesis, the first humans are
given a striking job description.

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:09.850
Fill the earth, subdue it, and have
dominion over every living thing that moves

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.340
on the earth.

4
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:16.340
Some readers take those words as permission
to use nature however humans like.

5
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.780
So does the Bible give humans
the right to rule nature,

6
00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.070
or the job of looking after it?

7
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:27.190
In this mission, you'll read the verses
closely and ask what kind of rule dominion

8
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.520
really is.

9
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:32.450
Then you'll ask what those ancient words
could mean for how people treat the planet

10
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.720
today.

11
00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:38.300
Your mission: weigh up whether the Bible
gives humans a right to rule nature,

12
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.200
or a duty to look after it.
